    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3029950099273771978, guid: ae5ae7c3ff1008f4c936a40c9bbedd02, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Two years in, and the backup manifold choked...     A minor failure,
        but enough to fry my pod and kick me out of cryo. I woke up to a flickering
        nav core and half the systems in failsafe.\r\n\r\nThe delay\u2019s measurable;
        <color=red>three years</color>, plus minus a couple of days. We\u2019re still
        headed the right way, just slower. Nothing I can\u2019t fix. Eventually.\r\n\r\nCouldn\u2019t
        wake you. Didn\u2019t want to. With the slowdown, I recalibrated your cryo
        pod, extended your sleep by the same three years.\r\n\r\nRebooting my cryo?
        Impossible. Needs a full station repair bay.\n\r\nI\u2019ll stay up. Someone
        has to keep the ship breathing. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8495083335092659354, guid: ae5ae7c3ff1008f4c936a40c9bbedd02, type: 3}
